      ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x)=\\tan(x)\\log(x),$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n**Hint:** $\\log(x)=\\log_{10}(x)$\n\n$f^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{\\ln{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\ln{\\left(10 \\right)}}\\,+$\n{{field-1}}",
